OL,3,GNEWSAMP's call for #120m maternity unit
OL,4,Asparks backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for a new #120m
OL,7,Fmaternity unit in Oxford ` but critics
OL,8,Fsay services are needed elsewhere.
OL,10,FLayla Moran, the Liberal Democrat MP
OL,11,Ffor Oxford West and Abingdon, called on
OL,12,Fthe government to deliver funding for
OL,13,Fthe new unit at the John Radcliffe
OL,14,FHospital.
OL,16,FThe concerns follow years of concerns
OL,17,Fabout maternity care at Oxford
OL,18,FUniversity Hospitals NHS Foundation
OL,19,FTrust.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
